					</div>
					<div>
						<Icon name="material-symbols:hub-outline" class="text-3xl" />
						<strong>診断</strong>
						<span>現状把握・優先順位</span>
					</div>
					<div>
						<Icon name="material-symbols:memory-alt-outline" class="text-3xl" />
						<strong>業務AI</strong>
						<span>記憶・承認・実装</span>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
